    "text": "Conjecture Let $(a_0,a_1,a_2,\\ldots,0)$ be a sequence of nonnegative integers which strictly decreases until $0$.\n\nThen there exists a graph that be drawn on a surface with orientable (nonorientable, resp.) genus $i$ with $a_i$ crossings, but not with less crossings.",
